  "job_B8.1.4.6_20251003_114821": {
    "chunk_text": "cr\u00e6ta, swa swa him bebead Drihten. He ferde \u00f0a to Asor mid fyrdlicum truman, & \u00f0a burh geeode, & \u00f0\u00e6r binnan ofsloh \u00f0one cyning & Ac hi forb\u00e6rnde Iosue, & ealle hyre f\u00e6stenu hi fordylgodon mid fyre, swa swa Moyses him bebead, \u00d0\u00e6ra burga hu\u00f0e hi h\u00e6fdon him gem\u00e6ne, & hi d\u00e6ldon \u00f0\u00e6t orf, swa him dihte Moyses: ne forlet Iosue \u00f0a gewylde eall \u00f0\u00e6t widgylle land manegra cyninga on muntum & on feldum, & \u00f0a cyningas Lange he w\u00e6s feohtende on fyrlynum burgum, & \u00e6lc buruhwaru w\u00e6s bugende to him, butan Eueum Drihten hi gehyrde \u00f0\u00e6t hi geh\u00e6fton wi\u00f0 hine, \u00f0\u00e6t hi feollon on \u00f0am gefeohte \u00e6tforan Israhela On \u00f0\u00e6re tide com Iosue & ofsloh Enachim on muntlandum Hebron & Dabir & Anab & of \u00e6lcum Iosue \u00f0a gewann mid wige \u00f0one eard, swa swa Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Moyse on \u00e6r, & he d\u00e6lde \u00f0\u00e6t land \u00d0IS synd \u00f0a cyningas \u00f0e Iosue ofsloh, & Israhela bearn, begeondan Iordane: \u00feis is se \u00e6resta, cyningc DRIHTEN \u00f0a forgeaf Israhela bearnum eallne \u00f0one eard, swa swa he behet heora ealdf\u00e6derum, & hi God him forgeaf \u00f0a sibbe on eallum ymbhwyrfte & nan wi\u00f0erwinna ne dorste winnan wi\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t folc, & Drihten eall gefylde \u00f0\u00e6t he him \u00e6r be",
